<title>UK: LME zinc ends PM kerb off highs, nickel near peak.</title>
<headline>LME zinc ends PM kerb off highs, nickel near peak.</headline>
<text>
<p>ZINC - Ends PM kerb up $13 at $1,122, but off fresh 23-month high of $1,132.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Holds above $7,400 at 2-1/2 month high.</p>
<p>COPPER - Finishes little changed after exploring both ends of range.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Firmer, but lacks momentum.</p>
<p>TIN - Adds to previous gains.</p>
<p>LEAD - Slightly higher.</p>
<p>ALLOY - Touch weaker.</p>
</text>
